#: ui/panel.py:1119
msgid "How firmly the swivel holds the elbow at its angle, against the tool's own weight of 50. On an arm with a spherical shoulder and wrist the elbow's goal is exactly reachable, so this barely matters: the arm7 fixture keeps its tool within 0.0003 mm from 0.5 to 20. On an arm whose links are offset the goal is only close -- watch the solve readout for tool error if you raise it"
msgstr "旋转控制将肘部保持在其角度的力度，以对抗工具自身 50 的重量。对于球形肩部和腕部的手臂，肘部目标可精确到达，因此这项几乎不重要：arm7 夹具在 0.5 到 20 之间时工具误差保持在 0.0003 毫米以内。对于连杆有偏移的手臂，目标只是接近——若调高此值，请留意求解读数中的工具误差"

